#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:817
msgid ""
"The sin() function returns the sine of x,\n"
"where x is given in radians.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:825
msgid ""
"The tan() function returns the tangent of x,\n"
"where x is given in radians.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:833
msgid ""
"The acos() function returns the arc cosine\n"
"in radians and the value is mathematically\n"
"defined to be between 0 and PI(inclusive).\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:843
msgid ""
"The asin() function returns the arc sine\n"
"in radians and the value is mathematically\n"
"defined to be between -PI/2 and PI/2 (inclusive).\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:853
msgid ""
"The atan() function returns the arc tangent\n"
"in radians and the value is mathematically\n"
"defined to be between -PI/2 and PI/2 (inclusive).\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:863
msgid ""
"The cosh() function returns the hyperbolic\n"
"cosine of x, which is defined\n"
"mathematically as (exp(x) + exp(-x)) / 2.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:873
msgid ""
"The  sinh()  function  returns the hyperbolic\n"
"sine of x,which is defined\n"
"mathematically as (exp(x) - exp(-x)) / 2.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:881
msgid ""
"The tanh() function returns the hyperbolic\n"
"tangent of x, which is defined\n"
"mathematically as sinh(x)/cosh(x).\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:891
msgid ""
"The acosh() function calculates\n"
"the inverse hyperbolic cosine of x;\n"
"that is the value whose hyperbolic\n"
"cosine is x. If x is less\n"
"than 1.0, acosh() returns not-a-number\n"
"(NaN) and errno is set.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:904
msgid ""
"The asinh() function  calculates\n"
"the inverse hyperbolic sine\n"
"of x; that is the value whose\n"
"hyperbolic sine is x.\n"
msgstr ""

#: kspread_dlg_formula.cc:915
msgid ""
"The atanh() function calculates\n"
"the inverse hyperbolic tangent of x;\n"
"that is the value whose hyperbolic\n"
"tangent is x. If the absolute value\n"
"of x is greater than 1.0, atanh()\n"
"returns not-a-number (NaN)\n"
msgstr ""

